# Bandit Level 09-10

## Objective
-Find the password within a file of random data types, preceeded by ===========

## Approach
-use man on grep
-use strings
## Commands / Tools

```bash
man grep
strings data.txt | grep -E "==+"
```
Reasoning 
-strings data.txt returns only string data
-grep -E "==+" returns the only strings which include any amount of ==

Result - Resolved level 10 password

What I learned
-How to get only the string from a text file
-How to use grep to find patterns in a string
